# Chrome Dome: "{5}: Create a token that's a copy of another target artifact you control. That token gains haste.
# Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step." On turn three Bot1 floats five mana from its Moxen. Chrome Dome is
# not "another" artifact and Bot2's Ornithopter is not Bot1's, so neither is a legal target; the ability copies Bot1's
# Ornithopter. The token is a 1/2 flyer (Chrome Dome's +1/+0), has haste, attacks the turn it arrives and Bot2 goes to 19,
# and it is sacrificed at the beginning of the end step, leaving the original (CR 707.2, 702.10, 603.7).

